  user_2,Hi Rohan this is Sunita from Protect All Agency How can I assist you today
  user_1,Hi Sunita I am calling about my home policy with DCoders I need to make some changes
  user_2,Okay sure thing Can you please provide me with your policy number so I can look into it
  user_1,It's HP-001234
  user_2,Alright thank you [typing] Ah yes I have your policy details here What changes would you like to make
  user_1,Actually I am moving to a new house and I want to cancel my current policy
  user_2,I see [sighs] Okay that's a big change Let me just check a few things [pause] Yes we can definitely assist you with the cancellation
  user_1,Great thank you How long will it take to process
  user_2,It should take about 3-5 business days for the cancellation to be effective
  user_1,Okay that sounds good And will I get a refund for the remaining premium
  user_2,Yes you will receive a refund for the unused portion of your premium [pause] I will go ahead and process the cancellation for you